WEBVTT

00:03:59.454 --> 00:04:02.621
and when Abed went on
about how hurt he was in the crash,

00:04:02.621 --> 00:04:04.871
I didn't say that I knew
from the police report

00:04:04.913 --> 00:04:06.788
that he'd escaped serious injury.

00:04:07.413 --> 00:04:09.954
I said I wanted to meet.

00:04:10.954 --> 00:04:14.079
Abed said that I should
call back in a few weeks,

00:04:14.079 --> 00:04:18.954
and when I did and a recording told me
that his number was disconnected,

00:04:18.996 --> 00:04:22.204
I let Abed and the crash go.

00:04:23.746 --> 00:04:25.538
Many years passed.

00:04:26.038 --> 00:04:30.121
I walked with my cane
and my ankle brace and a backpack